{"title": "Radiating Orb (Condition)", "pageid": 9589, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Radiating_Orb_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions", "Light Emitting"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the condition. For items that grant or interact with it, see <a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_set\" title=\"Luminous set\">Luminous set</a>.   </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiating Orb Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Radiating Orb</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <b>-1</b> to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> per remaining turn. It also sheds bright light in an area surrounding it.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Reduce the duration by 2 each time the entity makes an attack. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_RADIANT_RADIATING_ORB</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMAG_RADIANT_RADIATING_ORB%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMAG_RADIANT_RADIATING_ORB%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: add to duration\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/MultiplyEffectsByDuration\" title=\"Status properties/MultiplyEffectsByDuration\">MultiplyEffectsByDuration</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The bright light from this condition does not count as <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\">Daylight</a>.</li>\n<li>Duration of the condition is limited to a maximum of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10 turns; a maximum effect of <b>-10</b> to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> from this condition.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Radiating_Orb\">Sources of Radiating Orb</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Coruscation_Ring\" title=\"Coruscation Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Coruscation_Ring\" title=\"Coruscation Ring\">Coruscation Ring</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fabricated_Arbalest\" title=\"Fabricated Arbalest\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" wid