iew source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Illuminating_Shot\" title=\"Illuminating Shot\">Illuminating Shot</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>MAG_RADIANT_RADIATING_ORB</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Lunar_Radiance\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Radiance_(Condition)\" title=\"Lunar Radiance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lunar Radiance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Radiance_(Condition)\" title=\"Lunar Radiance (Condition)\">Lunar Radiance</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity has -2 to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. It also sheds bright light in an area surrounding it.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Radiating_Orb\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Orb_(Condition)\" title=\"Radiating Orb (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiating Orb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Radiating Orb</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <b>-1</b> to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> per remaining turn. It also sheds bright light in an area surrounding it.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Reduce the duration by 2 each time the entity makes an attack.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223433\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.112 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.125 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5137/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89747/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24698/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.071/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1279867/52428800 bytes\n--